team_fallback:
  current: single lead agent using explicit review checklist
  reason: bounded review and remediation of a known finding list
  lost_challenge: >-
    independent reviewer; mitigated by 325 automated tests, mutation-checking each new
    test against the bug it guards, and end-to-end verification of the commit gate
